  "notes": "Muted slate-blue (#6b7a99) is the only brand color: nav rail fill, primary button, links, icons, badge. Light gray canvas with white/near-white 8px-rounded panels with 1px #dee2e6 borders and no shadows. Collapsed accordion headers are #f8f9fa with large line icon + title + gray description. Transport cards lay attributes out as label-over-value columns (From/To/Flight Number/Airline/Confirmation Code/Seats/Cost) with a large line pictogram (plane/car) at left and ⋯ kebab top-right; attachment chips sit in a divided footer row. Airport/place names have small info icons that reveal a hover card with full airport name and timezone chip. Verdana gives a distinctive old-web/self-hosted feel. Footer is fixed to viewport bottom."
